    0.13.0.151-dev - 2026/05/31 (7a4c1cf7) [fix/mcp-tool-binding-test-isolation]
        :brief strict acceptance 主验收纳入开发手册渲染检查
        :test
            - test(acceptance): development-docs-check 改为调用 check-development-docs.ps1 -Render，主验收报告也确认工具条、目录、搜索与复制按钮实际挂载
            - test(acceptance): strict-acceptance 单测要求开发手册检查携带 -Render，避免退回静态扫描
